# damage to it at once, the page asks whose damage the shield prevents first and how much it has left (CR 615.7). Bot1
# clicks the Preacher: its 2 is prevented, then 1 of the Gorilla's, and Bot1's Gorilla lives with 1 damage. The same game
# headless is healing-salve-shield-on-a-double-blocked-creature-its-controller-chooses-the-deathtouch-damage.

